    <bpmn:process id="W_W4645" name="W4645. New-Revenue-Stream / New-Channel Pre-Launch PFRS 15 Assessment &amp; Accounting Decision" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Proposed new revenue stream / new channel (e.g., a new Pass-17-style service, new marketplace, new subscription)
Frequency: Per new stream
Volume: ~2–5 new streams/yr (recent growth: retail media, marketplace, VAS, captive, construction finance, trade-in)
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager
Participants: Channel owner, Strategy (VS-33), Legal (VS-100.3), Tax (VS-79), IT (VS-27/VS-113), Controller, CFO
Source: workflow W4645 — New-Revenue-Stream / New-Channel Pre-Launch PFRS 15 Assessment &amp; Accounting Decision</bpmn:documentation>
