        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4645_Start3" name="Proposed new revenue stream / new channel (e.g., a new Pass-17-style service, new…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4645_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4645_Task4" name="For each proposed new stream, conduct the pre-launch PFRS 15 assessment BEFORE…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: For each proposed new stream, conduct the pre-launch PFRS 15 assessment BEFORE go-live: contract identification (W4626), performance obligations (W4627), principal-vs-agent (W4628), SSP/allocation (W4633/W4634), variable consideration (W4638), financing component (W4639), contract costs (W4640) — produce a documented accounting decision
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Channel / Legal / Tax
Accountable (A): Controller / CFO
Duration: Per stream</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4645_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4645_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4645_Task5" name="Configure the IT/ERP posting to match the decision (W4646); add the stream to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Configure the IT/ERP posting to match the decision (W4646); add the stream to the revenue-stream register (W4625) and disclosure schedule (W4643); brief the External Auditor on the new stream&#x27;s treatment
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / IT / Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per stream</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4645_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4645_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4645_Task6" name="Gate go-live on the documented decision, IT config, and register entry; monitor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Gate go-live on the documented decision, IT config, and register entry; monitor the first close cycle for the new stream and true-up estimates (W4641)
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per launch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4645_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4645_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4645_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4645_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4645_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-703 (ensure controlled execution — Period Close, Disclosure, Audit &amp; New-Revenue-Stream Onboarding (PA-157.3).) | - CTL-703: no new stream goes live without a documented PFRS 15 decision and matching IT config (go-live gate); External Auditor briefed
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
