      <bpmn:userTask id="W4646_Task6" name="Configure and maintain the revenue-IT landscape: SSP/allocation engine…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Configure and maintain the revenue-IT landscape: SSP/allocation engine (W4633/W4634), deferred-revenue schedules (gift card, points, subscription, warranty), gross-vs-net routing (W4628), and GL account mapping per stream/obligation/entity
Responsible (R): IT Finance Lead / Revenue Accounting
