        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govern changes through change-control (VS-27.1): test config in non-prod, document the change, obtain Controller sign-off, deploy; maintain the config-to-accounting-decision traceability matrix
Responsible (R): IT / Revenue Accounting
Accountable (A): CIO / Controller
Duration: Per change</bpmn:documentation>
