        <bpmn:outgoing>W4646_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4646_Task8" name="Periodically review the config for drift from documented decisions (e.g., stale…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Periodically review the config for drift from documented decisions (e.g., stale SSP in the engine, wrong GL routing); reconcile config to the register (W4625) and remediate
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / IT
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Semi-annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4646_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4646_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
