    <bpmn:process id="W_W4647" name="W4647. Contract-Liability, Contract-Asset &amp; AR-Receivable Reconciliation &amp; Cut-off" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Month-end close (W9A); quarter/year-end
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: Contract-liability balances (deferred revenue, deposits); contract-asset balances (unbilled project revenue); AR (VS-16)
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager
Participants: AR (VS-16), Project Finance (VS-11), Controller
Source: workflow W4647 — Contract-Liability, Contract-Asset &amp; AR-Receivable Reconciliation &amp; Cut-off</bpmn:documentation>
