      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4647_Task4" name="Reconcile the contract-liability GL (deferred revenue — gift card, points…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Reconcile the contract-liability GL (deferred revenue — gift card, points, subscription, warranty, deposits) to the underlying schedules each month; investigate unmatched items
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4647_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4647_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4647_Task5" name="Reconcile the contract-asset GL (recognized-but-unbilled project/government…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Reconcile the contract-asset GL (recognized-but-unbilled project/government revenue) to billings (W165/W1288) and the project module; reconcile AR (VS-16) to revenue cut-off (revenue recognized in the period the customer is billed or delivery occurs)
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Project Finance / AR
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4647_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4647_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4647_Task6" name="Perform cut-off testing at period-end (shipments/deliveries/services near the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Perform cut-off testing at period-end (shipments/deliveries/services near the period boundary posted to the correct period); clear reconciling items before close sign-off
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4647_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4647_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
