        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-114 (ensure PFRS 15 recognition &amp; cut-off control.) | - CTL-703: contract balances reconciled monthly; cut-off tested each period; reconciling items cleared before sign-off
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
