    <bpmn:process id="W_W4648" name="W4648. Revenue-Recognition Internal Controls, SoD &amp; Audit-Trail Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Risk assessment; audit; control remediation; annual review
Frequency: Continuous + annual review
Volume: 1 PFRS 15 control set across 5 entities
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager / Controller
Participants: Internal Audit (VS-21), Revenue Assurance (VS-118), IT Security (VS-27.3), Controller
Source: workflow W4648 — Revenue-Recognition Internal Controls, SoD &amp; Audit-Trail Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4648_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4648_Lane1" name="Revenue Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4648_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4648_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4648_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4648_Lane2" name="Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4648_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4648_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4648_Start4" name="Risk assessment; audit; control remediation; annual review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4648_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4648_Task5" name="Maintain the PFRS 15 internal-control set: preventive (go-live gate W4645…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the PFRS 15 internal-control set: preventive (go-live gate W4645, config sign-off W4646, allocation-engine validation W4634) and detective (monthly reconcile W4647, variance clearance W4641, policy review W4642); map each to the internal-controls matrix
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Annual + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4648_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4648_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4648_Task6" name="Enforce segregation of duties: those who configure the engine (W4646), those…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Enforce segregation of duties: those who configure the engine (W4646), those who post journals (W4641), and those who reconcile (W4647) are separate; restrict manual-override and manual-journal authority
Responsible (R): Controller / IT Security
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4648_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4648_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4648_Task7" name="Preserve a complete audit trail (every allocation, deferral release, override…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Preserve a complete audit trail (every allocation, deferral release, override, estimate change) for 10 years (BIR/audit); coordinate with Revenue Assurance (VS-118) on transaction-level leakage vs. recognition-level error
Responsible (R): Revenue Accounting / IT / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4648_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4648_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4648_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4648_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4648_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-114 (ensure PFRS 15 recognition &amp; cut-off control.) | - CTL-703: documented control set mapped to internal-controls matrix; SoD enforced; audit trail retained 10 years; controls reviewed annually
Owner: Revenue Accounting Manager / Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
